 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Set `X-Larder-Site` to a site id; omitting the header selects `main`.
+An unknown site returns HTTP 400 with code `unknown_site`.
+Batches (including waste and order receipt locations), stock on hand, cooking,
+alerts, `/reports/stock-value` and stock-takes use only the selected site.
+A batch or stock-take in another site is unavailable, and a location in another
+site is rejected. Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
