 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+- `sites` lists sites by string `id` and `name`. Each location has a `site`
+  referring to a site id; batches and stock-takes belong to that site through
+  their location.
+- Schema 2 files migrate by adding site `main` ("Main kitchen") and assigning
+  every existing location to it. Schema 1 files migrate through schema 2 first.
+- Request stock operations use only the selected site's locations. Items,
+  suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared across sites.
